-- seeds rwa_issuers with every solana-deployed xstock from the official
-- production api: https://api.xstocks.fi/api/v2/public/assets (endpoint
-- documented at docs.xstocks.fi/apis/openapi/assets), fetched in full via
-- its page-based pagination. issuer_name is 'Backed Assets (JE) Limited',
-- confirmed as the exact legal issuer name in
-- docs.xstocks.fi/docs/product-legal-overview ("a Jersey-based special
-- purpose vehicle dedicated solely to the issuance and redemption of
-- xStocks"). asset_type is 'equity' for all rows: xStocks covers both
-- individual stocks and ETFs, and the api doesn't distinguish the two,
-- but both are equity instruments, not commodity/treasury/other.
--
-- the api returned 1026 verified solana mints; the xstocks.com homepage
-- separately advertises "811 Stocks and ETFs" with no status field in the
-- api response explaining the gap (only 7 of 1026 have isTradingHalted
-- true). every row here is still a verified, live mint address from the
-- official api -- see the chat for that discrepancy.
--
-- every single row was fetched from that api, not guessed.

on conflict (chain, mint_address) do nothing;
